{"seq":1,"slug":"systematic-review-methods","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 系统综述方法学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/synthesis/systematic-review-methods","wordCount":1977,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-循证医学-系统综述方法学\">研究生 循证医学 — 系统综述方法学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>系统综述方法学（Systematic Review Methods）是将零散的原始研究证据转化为可靠综合结论的科学流程。不同于传统文献综述的主观选择与叙述，系统综述通过预先注册的方案（Protocol）、全面透明的文献检索、标准化的筛选与质量评价、以及适当的统计合成，最大限度地减少偏倚和随机误差。Cochrane 协作网自 1993 年成立以来，已发布超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 篇系统综述，其方法学手册（Cochrane Handbook）被视为系统综述领域的&quot;圣经&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"系统综述的完整流程\">系统综述的完整流程</h3><p>系统综述遵循严格的七步流程，每一步都有明确的方法学规范：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[1. 提出研究问题 PICO] --&gt; B[2. 制定并注册方案]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3. 系统文献检索]&#10;    C --&gt; D[4. 研究筛选与纳入]&#10;    D --&gt; E[5. 数据提取与质量评价]&#10;    E --&gt; F[6. 数据合成与分析]&#10;    F --&gt; G[7. 结果解读与报告]&#10;    &#10;    B -.-&gt; H[PROSPERO 注册]&#10;    D -.-&gt; I[PRISMA 流程图]&#10;    E -.-&gt; J[RoB 2 / ROBINS-I]&#10;    F -.-&gt; K[Meta 分析 / 叙述性综合]&#10;    G -.-&gt; L[GRADE / SoF 表]\">graph TD\n    A[1. 提出研究问题 PICO] --&gt; B[2. 制定并注册方案]\n    B --&gt; C[3. 系统文献检索]\n    C --&gt; D[4. 研究筛选与纳入]\n    D --&gt; E[5. 数据提取与质量评价]\n    E --&gt; F[6. 数据合成与分析]\n    F --&gt; G[7. 结果解读与报告]\n    \n    B -.-&gt; H[PROSPERO 注册]\n    D -.-&gt; I[PRISMA 流程图]\n    E -.-&gt; J[RoB 2 / ROBINS-I]\n    F -.-&gt; K[Meta 分析 / 叙述性综合]\n    G -.-&gt; L[GRADE / SoF 表]</pre><h3 id=\"方案制定与预注册\">方案制定与预注册</h3><p>方案（Protocol）是系统综述的蓝图，应在开始检索前完成并公开注册。方案预注册的核心价值在于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>减少选择性报告</strong>：预设的分析计划限制了研究者根据结果调整方法的空间</li>\n<li><strong>提高透明度</strong>：读者可以对比方案与最终报告，识别偏离</li>\n<li><strong>避免重复劳动</strong>：其他研究者可以发现已在进行的综述</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PROSPERO（International Prospective Register of Systematic Reviews）是最广泛使用的注册平台，截至 2025 年已注册超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 项系统综述。</p>\n<p>方案的核心要素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>方法学考量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PICO</td>\n<td>精确的研究问题定义</td>\n<td>纳入/排除标准的操作化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索策略</td>\n<td>数据库、检索式、补充检索</td>\n<td>至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个数据库 + 灰色文献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>筛选流程</td>\n<td>标题/摘要 → 全文两阶段筛选</td>\n<td>双人独立 + 分歧解决机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据提取</td>\n<td>变量清单和提取表</td>\n<td>预先试用并校准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量评价</td>\n<td>偏倚风险工具选择</td>\n<td>RCT 用 RoB 2，NRS 用 ROBINS-I</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据合成</td>\n<td>合成方法和异质性处理策略</td>\n<td>预设亚组和敏感性分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"研究筛选与纳入决策\">研究筛选与纳入决策</h3><p>双人独立筛选是系统综述质量保障的关键环节。筛选采用两阶段策略：</p>\n<p><strong>第一阶段（标题/摘要筛选）</strong>：快速排除明显不相关的文献。疑似相关的文献一律保留进入全文评价。评审者间一致性（Inter-Rater Agreement）以 Cohen&#39;s <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 评估：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = \\frac{P_o - P_e}{1 - P_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为观察一致率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为期望一致率。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa \\geq 0.80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.80</span></span></span></span></span> 表示高度一致，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.60</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.79</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.79</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.79</span></span></span></span></span> 为中度一致。</p>\n<p><strong>第二阶段（全文筛选）</strong>：对每篇保留文献逐条对照纳入/排除标准。排除的文献需记录排除理由（PRISMA 2020 要求列出所有全文排除的研究及其理由）。</p>\n<p><strong>PRISMA 流程图</strong>是筛选过程的标准化报告工具：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;数据库检索 (n = 3,247)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;去重后 (n = 2,156)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;标题/摘要筛选排除 (n = 1,890)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;全文评价 (n = 266)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;全文排除 (n = 238)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;纳入定性综合 (n = 28)&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;纳入定量综合 Meta分析 (n = 22)&quot;]&#10;    &#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;不符合P (n = 89)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[&quot;不符合I (n = 67)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[&quot;不符合O (n = 45)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E4[&quot;研究设计不符 (n = 37)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"数据库检索 (n = 3,247)\"] --&gt; B[\"去重后 (n = 2,156)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"标题/摘要筛选排除 (n = 1,890)\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"全文评价 (n = 266)\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"全文排除 (n = 238)\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"纳入定性综合 (n = 28)\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"纳入定量综合 Meta分析 (n = 22)\"]\n    \n    E --&gt; E1[\"不符合P (n = 89)\"]\n    E --&gt; E2[\"不符合I (n = 67)\"]\n    E --&gt; E3[\"不符合O (n = 45)\"]\n    E --&gt; E4[\"研究设计不符 (n = 37)\"]</pre><h3 id=\"数据提取与管理\">数据提取与管理</h3><p>数据提取表（Data Extraction Form）应预先设计并在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 项研究上进行试用（Pilot），以发现定义模糊或遗漏的变量。</p>\n<p>标准提取变量包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>变量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>研究特征</td>\n<td>作者、年份、国家、研究设计、样本量、随访时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人群特征</td>\n<td>年龄、性别、疾病分期、合并症、基线风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干预/对照</td>\n<td>具体方案、剂量、给药方式、持续时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结局数据</td>\n<td>事件数/总数、均值/标准差、中位数/IQR、风险比/置信区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏倚风险</td>\n<td>各 RoB 2 域的判断及支持信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于缺失数据，应通过联系原始作者、从图表中数字化提取、或使用统计转换公式（如从中位数和 IQR 估计均值和 SD）获取：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mn>1.35</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x} \\approx \\frac{q_1 + m + q_3}{3}, \\quad SD \\approx \\frac{q_3 - q_1}{1.35}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.35</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"统计合成方法的选择\">统计合成方法的选择</h3><p>并非所有系统综述都适合进行 Meta 分析。决策框架：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>是否Meta分析</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>临床异质性</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>方法学异质性</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>研究数量</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{是否Meta分析} = f(\\text{临床异质性}, \\text{方法学异质性}, \\text{研究数量})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">是否</span><span class=\"mord\">Meta</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分析</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">临床异质性</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">方法学异质性</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">研究数量</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当临床问题、人群、干预和结局具有足够同质性，且至少有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 项研究提供可合并数据时，可以考虑 Meta 分析。</p>\n<p><strong>模型选择指导</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐模型</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>研究来自单一人群/条件</td>\n<td>固定效应</td>\n<td>研究估计同一效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>研究跨多个人群/条件</td>\n<td>随机效应</td>\n<td>需要估计效应的平均和分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>研究数量很少（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\leq 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>随机效应 + HKSJ 调整</td>\n<td>DL 方法在小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 时低估方差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>研究间存在剂量-反应关系</td>\n<td>剂量-反应 Meta 分析</td>\n<td>建模非线性关系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Hartung-Knapp-Sidik-Jonkman（HKSJ）方法通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 分布替代正态分布计算置信区间，在研究数量少时提供更保守（更准确）的推断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"敏感性分析与稳健性检验\">敏感性分析与稳健性检验</h3><p>敏感性分析评估合并结果对分析决策的依赖程度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析类型</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逐一排除</td>\n<td>评估单项研究的影响</td>\n<td>依次删除每项研究重新合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏倚风险分层</td>\n<td>评估质量对结论的影响</td>\n<td>仅纳入低偏倚风险研究的合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型敏感性</td>\n<td>评估统计模型选择的影响</td>\n<td>比较固定/随机效应结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失数据假设</td>\n<td>评估缺失数据处理的影响</td>\n<td>最好/最坏情景分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"叙述性综合\">叙述性综合</h3><p>当无法进行 Meta 分析时（如干预或结局定义差异过大），叙述性综合（Narrative Synthesis）提供结构化的定性汇总。SWiM（Synthesis Without Meta-Analysis）报告指南提供了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 条原则，确保叙述性综合的透明性和系统性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>你正在开展一项比较两种降压药物的系统综述。在全文筛选阶段，两位评审者对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 篇文献中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 篇判断不一致。请计算 Cohen&#39;s <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 值，评估一致性水平，并描述你将如何解决分歧。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在数据提取阶段，某项纳入的 RCT 仅报告了主要结局的中位数和四分位距（中位数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>12.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 12.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.5</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>8.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IQR: 8.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">QR</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18.7</span></span></span></span></span>），而 Meta 分析需要均值和标准差。请使用估算公式计算，并讨论该估算的局限性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>你的系统综述纳入了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 项 RCT，随机效应 DL 模型合并 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR = 0.65</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.65</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0.43</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\% CI: 0.43</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.43</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.98</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.98</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.98</span></span></span></span></span>），但 HKSJ 方法调整后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0.31</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\% CI: 0.31</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.31</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.36</span></span></span></span></span>。请解释两种方法结果差异的原因，以及在小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条件下哪种方法的推断更可靠。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一项系统综述的方案大纲，研究问题为：&quot;对于社区获得性肺炎住院成人患者，短疗程（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 天）与长疗程（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 天）抗生素治疗在临床治愈率和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 天死亡率方面是否等效？&quot;明确 PICO、纳入/排除标准、计划的亚组分析。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Higgins, J.P.T. et al. (2022)</strong>：Cochrane Handbook for Systematic Reviews of Interventions v6.3——系统综述方法学的权威手册</li>\n<li><strong>Page, M.J. et al. (2021)</strong>：&quot;The PRISMA 2020 Statement&quot;，BMJ——系统综述报告标准最新版</li>\n<li><strong>Campbell, M. et al. (2020)</strong>：&quot;Synthesis Without Meta-Analysis (SWiM) in Systematic Reviews&quot;，BMJ——叙述性综合的报告指南</li>\n<li><strong>Stewart, L.A. et al. (2015)</strong>：&quot;Preferred Reporting Items for a Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis of Individual Participant Data&quot;，JAMA——IPD Meta 分析报告标准</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>系统综述方法学通过预注册方案、全面检索、双人独立筛选与提取、标准化质量评价和适当的统计合成，将证据合成从主观艺术提升为可重复的科学过程。方法学的每个环节都有其特定的偏倚控制价值——方案预注册控制选择性报告，全面检索控制遗漏偏倚，双人独立操作控制评审者偏差，敏感性分析评估结论的稳健性。掌握这些方法学原则是进行和评价系统综述的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 循证医学 — 系统综述方法学","id":"研究生-循证医学-系统综述方法学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"系统综述的完整流程","id":"系统综述的完整流程"},{"level":3,"text":"方案制定与预注册","id":"方案制定与预注册"},{"level":3,"text":"研究筛选与纳入决策","id":"研究筛选与纳入决策"},{"level":3,"text":"数据提取与管理","id":"数据提取与管理"},{"level":3,"text":"统计合成方法的选择","id":"统计合成方法的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"敏感性分析与稳健性检验","id":"敏感性分析与稳健性检验"},{"level":3,"text":"叙述性综合","id":"叙述性综合"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 循证医学 — 诊断性研究的批判性评价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/critical-appraisal/appraising-diagnostic-studies"},"next":{"title":"研究生 循证医学 — 网状 Meta 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/synthesis/network-meta-analysis"}}